	)
	(text "Cable shields for the mute connection goes to the respective boards' GND plane\n- MCU board side connects the shield and also \n- Amplifier board side connects the shield\n- Mute board itself does not connect cable shield"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 56.134 161.544 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "76cd34c4-4e92-486f-9227-c712fdf864c8")
	)
	(text "Twisted wires 2 pairs + shield - \nLiYCY paar 2x2x 0.25mm2\nFor i2c interconnect, \nPairs - SDA+GND, SCL+GND\nShield connected on board#3 only together with both pairs gnd return.\nBoth gnd pairs connect together on board#2 and connect to gnda"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105.664 109.474 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a0177aa9-82c6-430d-a212-fcf563d7468b")
	)
	(text "Non-twisted wire 3 wires + shield\nLiYCY 3 x 0.34mm2   \nFor LDR + relay coil interconnect, \nshield goes to GNDD on board#3. No other gnd connection needed\n"
